From 6e404d4047c05174d74d0691bed78384f1e1a2d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 10:50:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/13] dexopt: compile apps right after the first boot of a
 build

first boot only verifies apps so it stays short, and the scheduled
background dexopt job waits for the device to be idle and charging,
so the apps can stay at verify for days. start the job once per
build when boot completes, ignoring those constraints, and show an
ongoing notification until it is done.
